ext1":"This oscillating stone is a timer-stone. You cannot interact with it, but nevertheless be aware when you see one: After some time-period anything might happen ...","text2":"The stones with arrows are one-way-stones. As you might have guessed, you can only pass them in one direction.                Mazes are cherished elements of Enigma - you will see lots of them.","text3":"Well done!     When you have finished this level, let's play some example levels from the actual Enigma packs!"}},{"id":"enigma:a_tut06","title":"Bye!","author":"Andreas Lochmann","license":"GPL v2.0 or above","map":["....................",".##################.",".##################.",".##################.",".##################.",".##################o",".##################.",".##################.",".##################.",".##################.",".##################.",".##################.","......o............."],"legend":{".":{"floor":"fl_lawn","stone":"st_oxyda"},"#":{"floor":"fl_lawn"},"o":{"floor":"fl_lawn","stone":"st_oxyd","flavor":"a","symbol":"A"}},"start":{"x":12.5,"y":6.5},"source":{"pack":"tutorial_basic","file":"a_tut06_2.xml"},"objects":[{"x":5,"y":6,"k":"it_document","a":{"$id":"3098549","text":"text2","$state":"0"}},{"x":7,"y":6,"k":"it_document","a":{"$id":"3098552","text":"text1","$state":"0"}}],"texts":{"text1":"But before this, take a look at the final tutorial level Jacob devised for you.   See it as an exam, if you want to.   It's quite difficult, so don't despair if you don't get through it at the first time.   Bye!","text2":"Well, I hope you enjoyed this tutorial-pack.   You will see most of these levels a second time in the Enigma packs, together with many new and much more difficult ones.   Just don't give up on them!"}}]}
